'@@author Rixte
@startuml
!include ../shortfall/readable.iuml
title Executing an agreed reset
participant "mishMash:MishMash" as App
participant "reset:ResetPlanCommand" as Reset
participant "activePlan:ActiveMealPlan" as Active
note over App, Reset
 Starts after agreement, or with no state to clear.
end note
App -> Reset : execute(recipeBook)
Reset -> Active : get()
Active --> Reset : previous plan
Reset -> Active : getGroceryList()
Active --> Reset : previous groceries
Reset -> Active : clear()
alt clear throws RuntimeException
 Reset --> App : throws MishMashException
else clear returns
 Reset -> Active : get()
 Active --> Reset : remaining plan
 Reset -> Active : getRequest()
 Active --> Reset : remaining request
 Reset -> Active : getGroceryList()
 Active --> Reset : remaining groceries
 alt any state remains
  Reset --> App : throws MishMashException
 else all state cleared
  Reset --> App : reset or no-plan feedback
 end
end

@enduml
'@@author
